    "text": "hawaiinewsnow.com\nwebsite\nKauai County, Hawaii\nRoad closures to take place on Kauai during marathon, half marathon\nBy HNN Staff,\n1 hours agoKOLOA (HawaiiNewsNow) - The County of Kauai has announced road closures ahead of the 2025 Kauai Marathon and Half Marathon. The marathon and half marathon will take place this Sunday, Aug. 31. The county said marathons will impact Koloa, Poipu, Lawai, and Kalaheo with a combination of lane, full road...",
